# Backend is hosted for real on Railway now — this is what "npx expo start"
# and the EAS build profiles use by default (see eas.json).
#
# Only override this with a LAN IP if you're testing against a *local*
# "npm run dev" backend instead of the hosted one: "localhost" means the
# phone itself, not this computer, so it'd need to be a real address the
# phone can reach (Windows: `ipconfig`, look for "Endereço IPv4" — it
# changes if the router reassigns a DHCP lease).
#
# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) if you need to override the default:
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://controle-financeiro-production-da55.up.railway.app
